OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FLocally cold start in the
OL,6,Fnorth, with the best of the sunshine
OL,7,Fhere. Cloudier, breezier and cooler
OL,8,Ffarther south with the odd shower,
OL,9,Fthough fewer than recently. Rather
OL,10,Fcold in the south, otherwise
OL,11,Ftemperatures near average.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA cloudy night for many, with
OL,14,Fthe odd shower. Clearer skies in the
OL,15,Fwest and northwest may allow some
OL,16,Ffrost and fog, while it stays milder
OL,17,Ffarther east under cloud.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
