OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FBrisk easterly winds across
OL,6,Fthe south with isolated showers,
OL,7,Fheaviest near southwest England later.
OL,8,FNorthern and northwestern areas see
OL,9,Fthe brightest conditions, though fog
OL,10,Fmay linger. Rather chilly further south
